Package: wildlifesystems-tools
Section: utils
Architecture: any
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}
Description: WildlifeSystems shared sensor utilities - tools
 ws-emit turns a reading described on the command line into WildlifeSystems
 reading JSON, using the same library code as the C sensor drivers. It lets a
 driver written in shell emit identical output instead of reimplementing the
 sc-prototype template, the unit spellings and the location tokens in jq.
 .
 Deliberately does not depend on sensor-control, which provides sc-prototype at
 runtime: that would be circular, since sensor-control depends on this package.

Package: libwildlifesystems-dev
Section: libdevel
Architecture: any
Depends: ${misc:Depends}
Description: WildlifeSystems shared sensor utilities - development files
 Static library and headers providing common functionality for
 WildlifeSystems sensor drivers.
